Subject: [PATCH] Equipment: reset the canvas context list on init

Component.init() pushed both canvas contexts onto a module-level array without
clearing it first. init() runs again whenever the component is re-initialised,
so the array grows by two each time.

renderEntity() loops over that array doing clearRect() then a sprite draw. The
draws complete asynchronously, so with stale duplicates the later draws land
after every clear and the character is composited more than once, slightly
offset - a figure with two heads, and item sprites left on the wrong canvas.
